# DianaSh golden corpus. Recorded from the C# shell, byte for byte; EMUSEN_DIANASH_GOLDEN=record rewrites it - see EmuSen_DianaSh.md §13.4.
# Patterns: <ROOT> is the sandbox's real root, <TEMP> the corpus's real temporary folder, <INSTALL> the install's real directory;
# a 'match' block is a regular expression the whole output must match, written where a line prints a time or a measured number.
command tile
usage 1   tile <space> <addr> <bpp>     ASCII-decode one 8x8 tile (bpp meaning is core-specific - 2/4/8 on SNES)

case an 8x8 tile
target fake
covers 1
$ tile
out 32
Usage: tile <space> <addr> <bpp>
status 0
action none
$ tile VRAM
out 32
Usage: tile <space> <addr> <bpp>
status 0
action none
$ tile VRAM 0 2
out 173
VRAM @ 0x0, 2bpp tile:
  . 1 2 3 . 1 2 3 
  . 1 2 3 . 1 2 3 
  . 1 2 3 . 1 2 3 
  . 1 2 3 . 1 2 3 
  . 1 2 3 . 1 2 3 
  . 1 2 3 . 1 2 3 
  . 1 2 3 . 1 2 3 
  . 1 2 3 . 1 2 3
status 0
action none
$ tile VRAM 0 4
out 173
VRAM @ 0x0, 4bpp tile:
  . D A 7 4 1 E B 
  8 5 2 F C 9 6 3 
  . D A 7 4 1 E B 
  8 5 2 F C 9 6 3 
  . D A 7 4 1 E B 
  8 5 2 F C 9 6 3 
  . D A 7 4 1 E B 
  8 5 2 F C 9 6 3
status 0
action none
$ tile VRAM 40 8
out 238
VRAM @ 0x40, 8bpp tile:
  40 4D 5A 67 74 81 8E 9B 
  A8 B5 C2 CF DC E9 F6 03 
  10 1D 2A 37 44 51 5E 6B 
  78 85 92 9F AC B9 C6 D3 
  E0 ED FA 07 14 21 2E 3B 
  48 55 62 6F 7C 89 96 A3 
  B0 BD CA D7 E4 F1 FE 0B 
  18 25 32 3F 4C 59 66 73
status 0
action none
$ tile VRAM 0 3
out 53
Error: 3bpp is not a tile format this target decodes.
status 1
action none
$ echo $?
out 1
1
status 0
action none
$ tile NOPE 0 2
out 83
Error: No memory space named 'NOPE'. Available: RAM, ROM, VRAM, IO, UNSIZED, CpuBus
status 1
action none
$ tile VRAM zz 2
out 46
Error: Could not find any recognizable digits.
status 1
action none
end

case with no target
target none
covers 1
$ tile VRAM 0 2
out 65
Error: No ROM loaded - this command needs an active debug target.
status 1
action none
end

case on venusrt
target venusrt
covers 1
$ tile VRAM 0 2
out 173
VRAM @ 0x0, 2bpp tile:
  . . . . . . . . 
  . . . . . . . . 
  . . . . . . . . 
  . . . . . . . . 
  . . . . . . . . 
  . . . . . . . . 
  . . . . . . . . 
  . . . . . . . .
status 0
action none
$ spaces
out 286
VenusRT memory spaces:
  CpuBus     16777216 bytes  R/W
  IO             1024 bytes  R/O
  WRAM         131072 bytes  R/W
  VRAM          65536 bytes  R/W
  CGRAM           512 bytes  R/W
  OAM             544 bytes  R/W
  SRAM              0 bytes  R/W
  APURAM        65536 bytes  R/W
status 0
action none
end

case on moonrt
target moonrt
covers 1
$ tile PPU 0 2
out 116
