case on nephrite
target nephrite
covers 1
$ tile VRAM 0 2
out 72
Nephrite decodes no tiles, so there is nothing to draw - see `man tile`.
status 1
action none
$ spaces
out 287
Nephrite memory spaces:
  M68KBUS    16777216 bytes  R/O
  Z80BUS        65536 bytes  R/O
  WRAM          65536 bytes  R/W
  Z80RAM         8192 bytes  R/W
  VRAM          65536 bytes  R/W
  CRAM            128 bytes  R/W
  VSRAM            80 bytes  R/W
